      "writtenOn": "2020-04-09T21:47:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the default PartionManager will set up mount points and do other initialization which we don\u0027t want during SAR-detection as fstab might be changed by the device-maintainer after SAR-detection using /sbin/sarsetup.sh boot-script.",
